# Klook zh-HK Blog Enrichment Flow

Use this flow when handling Klook zh-HK pages with special-character slugs.

## Seed Data Rules
- Keep `slug` as raw URL slug.
- Always create `decoded_slug` using URL decode + separator normalization.
- Reuse `translated_title_vi` as smart English title.
- Default translation source is `decoded_slug` (safe mode).
- Do NOT fetch page title by default.
- Only fetch title when user explicitly requests it.

## Geo Detection Priority
- Detect `country/city` from `translated_title_vi` first (clean title text to remove punctuation/noise).
- If geo is unknown, fallback to `decoded_slug`.
- If still unknown, fallback to `slug`.
- Save geo provenance in `metadata.geo_source`.

## Import Safety Rules
- Run PocketBase connection/schema test before import.
- For existing records, do not create duplicates.
- For existing records, patch `country/city` when new values are better than old values.
- Keep `languages` as JSON array; do not rely on `language` field.
- Do not treat `blocked/timeout/request_error` as invalid URL by default.

## Funnel Stage Classification (Critical for DSA)
- Classify `funnel_stage` with precedence: `readiness` > `planning` > `awareness`.
- Classification text priority: `translated_title_vi` first, fallback `decoded_slug`.
- Normalize text before matching: lowercase + remove punctuation/noise + collapse spaces.
- Save audit hints in metadata:
  - `metadata.funnel_source`: `translated_title_vi|decoded_slug`
  - `metadata.funnel_rule_hit`: first matched keyword
- If no keyword matches, default to `awareness`.
- Use both keyword-list and regex variants to improve matching coverage (e.g. `k-eta`, `e-visa`, `arrival form`).

### readiness keywords
- visit japan web
- visit japan, vjw
- arrival card, arrival form, entry form, landing card
- immigration, customs
- visa, e visa, evisa, travel visa, entry visa
- eta, k eta, k-eta, electronic travel authorization
- entry requirement, entry requirements, entry permit, travel requirement, border control
- passport validity, transit visa
- health declaration, customs declaration, declaration form, travel declaration

### planning keywords
- itinerary, travel plan, day trip, x day x night
- rail pass, jr pass, metro pass, transport pass
- airport transfer, airport express, from airport, to city
- sim card, esim, pocket wifi, wifi card
- budget, cost, price, fare, ticket, booking
- where to stay, best area, hotel area
- best time to visit, weather, season
- restaurant guide, must eat

### awareness keywords
- things to do, top attractions, best places
- travel guide, destination guide
- cherry blossom, autumn leaves, xmas, winter, summer, spring
- festival, event
- photo spot, instagrammable
- family activities, couple date ideas
- top 10, must visit, recommendation

## Klook Blog Scope Defaults
- `platform = klook`
- `sitemap_tag = blog`
- `canonical_id = "0"`
- `include_for_dsa = true`
- `exclude_for_dsa = false`
- `languages = ["zh-HK"]`

## Tiering Strategy for Blog
- Compute dynamic tier from funnel intent + freshness.
- Base tier by `funnel_stage`:
  - `readiness -> 1`
  - `planning -> 2`
  - `awareness -> 3`
- Freshness override:
  - if `translated_title_vi` contains `2025`, force `tier = 4`.
  - if `translated_title_vi` contains any year older than `2025`, force `tier = 5`.
  - if year is `2026` or no year is detected, use base tier from funnel stage.
- Save tier audit in metadata:
  - `metadata.year_detected`
  - `metadata.tier_source` (`funnel_stage` or `year_override`)
